- I can do what you do.

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:05.130
♪♪♪

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:09.217
- Oh, shit.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.721
- Oh, yeah, son!

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:13.555
- That is what I'm talking about.

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:14.389
Hell yeah.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:18.435
