00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.990
Hello, and welcome to "Underrated."

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.117
This is gonna be a good
one. I am Adam Lefkoe.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:36.494
Gotta give a shout-out to
our sponsor, State Farm,

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:38.496
with their surprisingly great rates.

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:40.790
Today's guest: Keenan Allen,

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:44.210
who surprises defenses every damn week.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.504
And he's also surprised
by his Madden rating,

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:48.631
and I'm not here to stand for it.

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:50.008
This is a biggie.

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:52.385
Keenan's had his run-ins
with Madden in the past.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.387
Jake, get Madden on the phone.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:58.725
- [Jake:] Calling Madden Ratings Adjuster.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.727
- Clint, old buddy, old pal.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:01.853
I have a big one.

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:03.438
Keenan Allen.

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:04.647
- Yeah, I love Keenan Allen.

00:01:04.647 --> 00:01:05.899
What has he got on his mind?

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.025
He's a huge Madden guy,

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.193
and you know I love hearing from Keenan.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:10.653
- You've seen his videos
in the past though, right?

00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:12.447
- Oh, absolutely.

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:14.449
- And I just wanna start
this video off by saying

00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:18.078
I will not be playing
Madden 20, all right?

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:21.539
No. 1, my overall is at 89.

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:23.041
- Well, I wanna do my part.

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.918
I wanna mend this relationship.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:27.837
Jake, get Keenan Allen on the line.

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:30.924
- [Jake:] Calling Keenan Allen.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:33.510
♪♪♪

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:42.018
- There he is, the man already stretching.

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:44.729
Those are All-Pro legs right there, sir.

00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:46.898
Keenan Allen, how you feelin', bro?

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:49.192
- Not bad, not bad, feelin' good.

00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:50.652
- The consensus around the league is

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:53.488
that you were one of the
most disrespected players

00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:55.615
from last year, but I
think you're special.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:59.202
And I wish that more people
saw it like I see it.

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:00.537
- I do too.

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:02.789
- Well, I've got your
ratings from this year.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.415
Would you like to see them?

00:02:04.415 --> 00:02:05.792
- Yeah, man. Let's get into that.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.961
- All right, so here is what we got.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:09.963
I'm looking at 90s across the board

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:12.549
for almost all of your
core receiver skills.

00:02:12.549 --> 00:02:14.926
You bumped them up
recently, short and medium,

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:16.094
but deep route running,

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:18.096
cuz I've seen this dude catch some bombs.

00:02:18.096 --> 00:02:19.681
How do I improve that?

00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:21.808
- So what you're looking
at for deep route running

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.935
is routes of 40 yards or more.

00:02:23.935 --> 00:02:26.604
Specifically double moves are in there.

00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:28.565
We're gonna look at his efficiency

00:02:28.565 --> 00:02:30.567
of cut and change of
direction in his double moves,

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:32.277
how well he keeps his speed,

00:02:32.277 --> 00:02:33.611
some of his shake and shiftiness

00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:34.571
in some of those double moves.

00:02:34.571 --> 00:02:36.406
And then, you know, deep over routes,

00:02:36.406 --> 00:02:38.449
deep crossing routes, verticals,

00:02:38.449 --> 00:02:39.909
a lot of those deeper routes you see

00:02:39.909 --> 00:02:41.411
run in the NFL these days.

00:02:41.411 --> 00:02:43.788
- Other one, change of direction.

00:02:43.788 --> 00:02:45.373
I think this man is quick.

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:48.251
How could I improve change
of direction for Keenan?

00:02:48.251 --> 00:02:49.085
- Ooh, that's a good one.

00:02:49.085 --> 00:02:51.754
So that's a new rating
coming in Madden 21.

00:02:51.754 --> 00:02:53.882
What we're looking for is efficiency

00:02:53.882 --> 00:02:55.758
in making drastic direction changes.

00:02:55.758 --> 00:02:58.261
How well can you keep your speed?

00:02:58.261 --> 00:02:59.554
And, you know, looking for

00:02:59.554 --> 00:03:02.223
false steps, footwork, things like that.

00:03:02.223 --> 00:03:03.766
Athleticism.

00:03:03.766 --> 00:03:05.852
- OK, I might have to call
a friend for that one.

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:07.979
This is a long time coming, Clint.

00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:09.981
Keenan, I think we can fix this.

00:03:09.981 --> 00:03:12.817
- Man, I've been playing the
game since I was six years old.

00:03:12.817 --> 00:03:15.862
Just a little bit of
respect is all I ask for.

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:17.572
- I'm gonna get the footage,
and I'm gonna bring it back.

00:03:17.572 --> 00:03:18.615
This will be big.

00:03:18.615 --> 00:03:19.866
- All right, talk to you.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.745
- All right, so, Keenan, I am feeling like

00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:25.455
there's an opportunity here

00:03:25.455 --> 00:03:27.290
to up your deep route running.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.500
Let's show Madden how crisp you are

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.629
and how quickly you
can separate from a DB.

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:34.672
- I like what you gettin'
at right here. I like that.

00:03:34.672 --> 00:03:35.632
Cuz my speed, it's not
great, but it's not-

00:03:35.632 --> 00:03:37.842
- Ain't that bad, but you ain't that fast.

00:03:37.842 --> 00:03:39.427
- Casey Hayward!

00:03:39.427 --> 00:03:42.055
- I ain't that fast, but I'm legit though.

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:43.389
- Can you do what I do?

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.933
- I can do what you do.

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:47.018
- Like this, all this?
- I got all of that.

00:03:47.018 --> 00:03:48.394
- Well, backpedaling is also

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:50.146
about how well you change direction.

00:03:50.146 --> 00:03:53.566
And since Casey's change
of direction is in the 90s,

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:54.651
let's put you up against him

00:03:54.651 --> 00:03:57.987
in a classic camp drill
from back in the day.

00:03:57.987 --> 00:03:59.739
- All right, let's do it.

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.866
- All right, so what we're gonna do is

00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:05.286
Casey is gonna try and
shake you out of your shoes.

00:04:05.286 --> 00:04:06.955
Now you've got to mirror him.

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:08.498
The longer you stay with him,

00:04:08.498 --> 00:04:10.583
the better your case for a ratings boost.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:13.169
♪♪♪

00:04:16.798 --> 00:04:17.757
- Oh, shit.

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:23.221
- Oh, yeah! Yes, sir!

00:04:23.221 --> 00:04:24.138
- How did I look?

00:04:24.138 --> 00:04:24.931
- How'd you look?

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:26.683
I'm more interested in how you felt.

00:04:26.683 --> 00:04:27.934
- I felt good.

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:28.768
- He looked good.

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:30.603
I was trying to get him off his game

00:04:30.603 --> 00:04:32.438
cuz I need his points to go up.

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:34.983
- Casey, I'm letting you know right now.

00:04:34.983 --> 00:04:37.402
If I find out that you're
letting him keep up-

00:04:37.402 --> 00:04:39.821
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:41.698
I don't let nobody win nothing.

00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:43.616
So if he's able to follow where I'm goin',

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:45.451
his points should go
up, cuz I'm going hard.

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:47.370
- OK, but I'm gonna need one more of these

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.830
to take back to Madden.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.123
- OK.

00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:54.919
♪♪♪

00:05:01.926 --> 00:05:05.138
- Ah, he doin' that right!

00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:06.723
- That is what I'm talkin' about!

00:05:06.723 --> 00:05:08.057
Hell yeah!

00:05:08.057 --> 00:05:09.434
- He was on form.

00:05:09.434 --> 00:05:11.978
- Casey, man, really
appreciate you coming out,

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:13.771
help your teammate today. Thank you.

00:05:13.771 --> 00:05:14.605
- All right.

00:05:14.605 --> 00:05:15.898
- Appreciate it, brother.

00:05:15.898 --> 00:05:19.527
- Now, Keenan, we need to
move on to the main event.

00:05:19.527 --> 00:05:20.778
Before we get going,

00:05:20.778 --> 00:05:22.947
I did talk to the Madden ratings adjuster.

00:05:22.947 --> 00:05:25.992
He told me there are a
few routes he's gotta see

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:27.910
before he does a ratings change.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.829
How are we feeling about a skinny post?

00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:31.080
- That's easy money.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.041
- All right, how about post corner?

00:05:33.041 --> 00:05:34.208
- That's easy money.

00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:35.126
- Out and up?

00:05:35.126 --> 00:05:36.544
- Easier money.

00:05:36.544 --> 00:05:39.797
- And I'm gonna imagine that a
deep drag is also easy money?

00:05:39.797 --> 00:05:40.631
- Yeah, absolutely.

00:05:40.631 --> 00:05:43.551
- And since no other
receiver compares to you,

00:05:43.551 --> 00:05:46.763
let's show 'em how well you
match up against yourself.

00:05:46.763 --> 00:05:48.514
Because if you can run cleaner routes

00:05:48.514 --> 00:05:52.226
than your Madden character, it's a wrap.

00:05:52.226 --> 00:05:54.103
Which one of these do
you wanna start off with?

00:05:54.103 --> 00:05:56.647
- We could do the deep drag one.

00:05:56.647 --> 00:05:57.482
- All right.

00:05:57.482 --> 00:05:59.150
Deep drag it is, man.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:02.320
♪♪♪

00:06:10.453 --> 00:06:12.038
Hey! Am I finishing?

00:06:12.038 --> 00:06:13.539
Do I gotta finish?

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:15.041
That's life, Adam.

00:06:15.041 --> 00:06:17.502
- By the way, who is
the quarterback today?

00:06:17.502 --> 00:06:19.796
- My brother, Zach Maynard.

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:22.382
Connection.

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:25.385
- Ah, see, it's that family connection.

00:06:25.385 --> 00:06:26.761
All right, skinny post.

00:06:26.761 --> 00:06:30.264
Looking like it's gotta be about 12 yards.

00:06:32.809 --> 00:06:33.851
There it is.

00:06:35.853 --> 00:06:36.687
- Did you see that?

00:06:36.687 --> 00:06:38.272
- Yeah, I did.

00:06:38.272 --> 00:06:39.690
- Come on, man.

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.442
- [Lefkoe:] So the last
one that I have here, man,

00:06:41.442 --> 00:06:42.944
is the out and up.

00:06:42.944 --> 00:06:46.197
♪♪♪

00:06:48.699 --> 00:06:50.952
That was perfect, man.

00:06:50.952 --> 00:06:52.537
- Hey, man, it's what I do.

00:06:52.537 --> 00:06:53.371
Flawless.

00:06:53.371 --> 00:06:54.914
Ain't no DBs out here.

00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:57.458
- So, Keenan, I'm gonna take those gems

00:06:57.458 --> 00:06:58.793
that you just put on tape.

00:06:58.793 --> 00:07:01.087
I'm gonna package them up perfectly.

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:03.714
I'm gonna ship 'em off
to my people at Madden.

00:07:03.714 --> 00:07:06.801
And just in case they're still trippin',

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:08.219
I'm gonna get you on the phone.

00:07:08.219 --> 00:07:09.512
You can let 'em have it,

00:07:09.512 --> 00:07:11.514
and we can really talk
some sense into them.

00:07:11.514 --> 00:07:12.557
OK?

00:07:12.557 --> 00:07:15.351
- Yeah, man. We gotta talk to
'em just a little bit more,

00:07:15.351 --> 00:07:17.186
and I think we been
showing 'em on the field.

00:07:17.186 --> 00:07:19.689
We been showing 'em,
and they not, they not,

00:07:19.689 --> 00:07:21.190
it's not converting to 'em real well

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:22.024
how it's supposed to be.

00:07:22.024 --> 00:07:24.193
So maybe they need a
little word of advice.

00:07:24.193 --> 00:07:25.319
- All right.

00:07:25.319 --> 00:07:26.821
Keenan, you are the man.

00:07:26.821 --> 00:07:30.032
I appreciate you, and I
will be talking to you soon.

00:07:30.032 --> 00:07:32.618
- Thank you, man. Appreciate it.

00:07:39.876 --> 00:07:41.836
- Clint, Keenan went out there.

00:07:41.836 --> 00:07:43.087
He gave it to you.

00:07:43.087 --> 00:07:45.548
Your initial reaction of seeing the video?

00:07:45.548 --> 00:07:48.759
- Hey, great video once again, Lefkoe.

00:07:48.759 --> 00:07:50.970
You know, Keenan has
been a guy that always

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.346
calls us out to his camps.

00:07:52.346 --> 00:07:54.515
We've always had a very close eye on him.

00:07:54.515 --> 00:07:57.810
So, much more of the same,
you know? Very fluid athlete.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.313
- Let's get Keenan on the call.

00:08:00.313 --> 00:08:02.106
Keenan, with the beard!

00:08:02.106 --> 00:08:03.858
- What's up, bro? What's it do?

00:08:03.858 --> 00:08:07.320
- Clint, let's talk about
these particular ratings.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:09.113
In terms of the deep-ball route running,

00:08:09.113 --> 00:08:10.490
we went on that because Keenan's

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:12.033
already high in short and medium.

00:08:12.033 --> 00:08:15.620
- He is a top-10 wide
receiver in Madden already.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.538
So, saw a lot of the
things that we already knew

00:08:17.538 --> 00:08:18.789
in that portion of the tape.

00:08:18.789 --> 00:08:20.124
- Change of direction.

00:08:20.124 --> 00:08:21.918
The guy he went up against, Casey Hayward,

00:08:21.918 --> 00:08:23.169
one of the best in the game.

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:24.795
What are we doing there?

00:08:24.795 --> 00:08:28.466
Keenan, you are going to get
bumped up from an 88 to an 89.

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:33.804
- You mean to tell me I spent two hours

00:08:33.804 --> 00:08:35.848
to get one attribute?

00:08:35.848 --> 00:08:38.309
- You're the seventh-best
receiver in the game.

00:08:38.309 --> 00:08:39.727
- It's a mind thing, you
know what I'm saying?

00:08:39.727 --> 00:08:43.022
When I see the attributes,
based on other guys' attributes,

00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:45.733
that I know I have better attributes,

00:08:45.733 --> 00:08:47.360
it's just a little mind-boggling.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.278
- This is deep in Keenan's heart.

00:08:49.278 --> 00:08:50.112
- Absolutely.

00:08:50.112 --> 00:08:51.614
This is so real. I can't make it up.

00:08:51.614 --> 00:08:54.242
- Clint, so I'm gonna ask
you one quick question.

00:08:54.242 --> 00:08:57.161
Is Keenan Allen underrated?

00:08:57.161 --> 00:08:58.454
- Just, just a little bit.

00:08:58.454 --> 00:08:59.747
He's underrated just a little bit,

00:08:59.747 --> 00:09:02.959
but we got him pretty
close. Got him pretty close.

00:09:02.959 --> 00:09:04.252
- Just a little bit?

00:09:04.252 --> 00:09:06.420
- So really what he's
saying is, "I love you,

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.130
but you got me fucked up,

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:10.758
and we're here to keep an eye on it."

00:09:10.758 --> 00:09:13.511
- Took the words out of my mouth, bro.

00:09:13.511 --> 00:09:16.013
- I appreciate the passion very much.

00:09:16.013 --> 00:09:17.265
And the best thing about Madden is

00:09:17.265 --> 00:09:19.350
we update our ratings every single week.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.434
So you put it on film,

00:09:20.434 --> 00:09:21.269
we're gonna see it.

00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:22.311
- That is true.

00:09:22.311 --> 00:09:23.145
- You're gonna go up.

00:09:23.145 --> 00:09:24.272
- I'm not worried. I
know it's gonna go up.

00:09:24.272 --> 00:09:25.481
I go up every time.

00:09:25.481 --> 00:09:27.858
I'm not worried about that.

00:09:27.858 --> 00:09:31.279
- The passion that Keenan
has, it is surprisingly great.

00:09:31.279 --> 00:09:33.864
Just like the rates at State Farm.

00:09:33.864 --> 00:09:36.450
Thank you for watching another
episode of "Underrated."

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.828
I'm gonna be honest,
I feel bad for Keenan.

00:09:38.828 --> 00:09:40.329
I just wanna go and hug him.

00:09:41.539 --> 00:09:42.957
We're gonna get these ratings better.

00:09:42.957 --> 00:09:45.334
I promise, Keenan. I'm sorry!

00:09:45.334 --> 00:09:48.504
♪♪♪

